mp endorsed him and rival Jackson Lahmeyer withdrew, and he enters the general election with a decisive financial edge, having raised about $2.5 million with outside support, while Democrat John Croisant has raised roughly $217,000.\n\nNo public general-election polling exists, so the race is judged on fundamentals: the district's R+11 lean, a favorable Republican environment, and unanimous expert ratings of Safe or Solid R. Prediction markets similarly give Croisant only a small chance. The forecast expects Tedford to win by a wide, double-digit margin, with the open seat adding little uncertainty beyond the district's normal partisan behavior.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.0439, "margin": -11.04}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.0097, "margin": -18.0}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.0191, "margin": -15.0}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.0497, "margin": -12.0}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.0244, "margin": -13.0}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.0398, "margin": -12.5}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.05, "margin": -12.5}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.0401, "margin": -13.0}, {"date": "2026-09-30", "p_dem": 0.0392, "margin": -12.0}, {"date": "2026-10-01", "p_dem": 0.0141, "margin": -14.0}, {"date": "2026-10-02", "p_dem": 0.021, "margin": -14.0}, {"date": "2026-10-03", "p_dem": 0.0228, "margin": -14.0}, {"date": "2026-10-04", "p_dem": 0.033, "margin": -14.0}, {"date": "2026-10-05", "p_dem": 0.0238, "margin": -13.0}, {"date": "2026-10-06", "p_dem": 0.0259, "margin": -13.0}, {"date": "2026-10-07", "p_dem": 0.0198, "margin": -14.0}, {"date": "2026-10-08", "p_dem": 0.0096, "margin": -14.0}, {"date": "2026-10-09", "p_dem": 0.0036, "margin": -18.0}, {"date": "2026-10-10", "p_dem": 0.0029, "margin": -18.0}, {"date": "2026-10-11", "p_dem": 0.0175, "margin": -14.0}, {"date": "2026-10-12", "p_dem": 0.0049, "margin": -18.0}, {"date": "2026-10-13", "p_dem": 0.0123, "margin": -14.0}, {"date": "2026-10-14", "p_dem": 0.0108, "margin": -14.0}, {